# Open in VS Code and click "Send Request" (REST Client extension).
# Local run (dotnet run): http://localhost:5301   Through Traefik (later): http://localhost:8000
# Needs customers-api and billing-api running too (gRPC), plus SQL Server and Redis.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5301

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/health

### Place an order: checks the customer over gRPC, saves it, asks billing-api (gRPC) for an invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "product": "Laptop stand",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 2250
}

### Order details: send twice and compare the X-Cache response header (MISS, then HIT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### Unknown customer: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999,
  "product": "Ghost item",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10
}

### All orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
